                                                                els
considered for autocorrelation detection. ρ̂k is the sample autocorrelation coefficient at
                                  号
lag k. Q is the Ljung Box statistic, which follows an approximate chi square distribution
under the null hypothesis with degrees of freedom h − m, where m is the number of


                                                              od
parameters in the model (for simple time series analysis, m is typically taken as m = 0).
