Bayesian network model, to enhance player performance through the nuanced con-
cept of "momentum" in tennis. In the dynamic world of competitive tennis, the concept
    微




of "momentum" is often cited as a game-changer, potentially turning the tide in pivotal
match moments. This elusive force is thought to shape match outcomes. Our research
